Program1 : Write a program to take input of two integer then print addition and multiplication.

SourceCode :
#include <stdio.h>

int main() {
    int a, b;
    int sum, product;

    printf("Enter first number: ");
    scanf("%d", &a);

    printf("Enter second number: ");
    scanf("%d", &b);

    sum = a + b;
    product = a * b;

    printf("Addition = %d\n", sum);
    printf("Multiplication = %d\n", product);

    return 0;
}

Output :
Enter first number: 2
Enter second number: 4
Addition = 6
Multiplication = 8

